id=susfs_lkm_x64
name=SUSFS LKM x86_64
version=v0.0.6
versionCode=6
author=ymuuu, inforcqb
description=Loads the x86_64 susfs LKM at boot on the android12-5.10 .. android17-6.18 x86_64 GKI kernels, auto-selected by kernel release (runtime-tested on the Android 16 x86_64 emulator, android15-6.6; the rest are CI-built). sus_map now also hides mappings from /proc/<pid>/pagemap on x86_64. The /proc/susfs_* control nodes follow the KernelSU su gate only where they carry the ksu_file label, root-only otherwise (always on 6.4+). Synced with upstream susfs4ksu-lkm through ba5c6d0. Also installs the x86_64 susfs CLI. Port repo: susfs4ksu-lkm-x64.
